# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# Environment — the client reads AGENTIC_OS_* from the environment.
# A partner's deployment URL and credential are theirs; they never travel.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# `.env` and `.env.*` do not match a secrets file named any other way, such as
# `.secrets-env-<name>.env` or `deploy.env`. These two lines close that gap.
*.env
.secrets*

# Editors / OS
.DS_Store
.idea/
*.swp

# ⛔ NOT ignored, deliberately: .claude/ .codex/ .gemini/ CLAUDE.md AGENTS.md
# GEMINI.md coc-projection.json — the CLI wiring is the point of this repository
# and must travel with the clone. Ignoring it would leave a partner with a
# clone that opens into an empty CLI, which is the failure this repository
# exists to fix.
